r": "根据 FAQ 和服务政策，七天无理由退货需同时满足以下条件：\n\n✅ **时间要求**：自商品签收之日起 7 天内（含签收当日）；  \n✅ **商品状态**：保持完好、未使用、未损坏，包装及配件齐全，不影响二次销售；  \n❌ **不适用范围**（明确排除）：  \n- 定制类、生鲜类商品（见 F007 和 SP001）；  \n- 已拆封的个人护理类商品（如美妆、贴身内衣等）；  \n- 虚拟商品（如充值卡、电子券等）（SP001）。\n\n📌 **其他说明**：  \n- 退货运费由买家承担；若购买了运费险，按保单规则赔付（SP001）；  \n- 如遇质量问题（破损/错发/漏发等），适用【SP003】——可享15天内免运费退换，需提供开箱视频或照片凭证。\n\n需要我帮您确认某类商品是否符合无理由退货条件吗？", "session_id": "sess-dacd2ce5b140"}, "error": null, "waiting_reason": null, "continuation_token": null}, "error": null, "reason": "能力执行完成"}}, "events": [{"sequence": 1, "ts": "2026-10-15T09:16:44.090882+00:00", "level": "info", "trace_id": "trace-600f22da6cb245ee", "task_id": "task-eb9f22a229b0", "request_id": null, "step_id": "s1", "capability_id": "m2.order_tracking", "status": "pending", "reason": "已加入执行计划", "error_code": null}, {"sequence": 2, "ts": "2026-10-15T09:16:44.090939+00:00", "level": "info", "trace_id": "trace-600f22da6cb245ee", "task_id": "task-eb9f22a229b0", "request_id": null, "step_id": "s2", "capability_id": "m7.refund_approval", "status": "pending", "reason": "已加入执行计划", "error_code": null}, {"sequence": 3, "ts": "2026-10-15T09:16:44.090947+00:00", "level": "info", "trace_id": "trace-600f22da6cb245ee", "task_id": "task-eb9f22a229b0", "request_id": null, "step_id": "s3", "capability_id": "m1.faq_chat", "status": "pending", "reason": "已加入执行计划", "error_code": null}, {"sequence": 4, "ts": "2026-10-15T09:16:44.090973+00:00", "level": "info", "trace_id": "trace-600f22da6cb245ee", "task_id": "task-eb9f22a229b0", "request_id": "req-4c871d70a4f1", "step_id": "s1", "capability_id": "m2.order_tracking", "status": "running", "reason": "解析输入并调用能力", "error_code": null}, {"sequence": 5, "ts": "2026-10-15T09:16:49.766930+00:00", "level": "info", "trace_id": "trace-600f22da6cb245ee", "task_id": "task-eb9f22a229b0", "request_id": "req-4c871d70a4f1", "step_id": "s1", "capability_id": "m2.order_tracking", "status": "completed", "reason": "能力执行完成", "error_code": null}, {"sequence": 6, "ts": "2026-10-15T0